      "content": "idk i dont know if they see courage. i just see them looking at me with this look of pity... like they're just waiting for the next crisis. it's like instead of living their lives they're just managing mine. i'd feel so much better if they could just have their freedom back. i feel like i'm just standing in the way of their happiness.",
